    "adapt": "Vanilla bird flocks (SCR_Bird, no art, no sound of our own). Two domestic pigeon flocks go on open paving of the square, clear of the fountain basin and the cafe terrace; one seagull flock goes on the dock apron or a quay edge, not on a roof. A flock spawns where it stands and lifts off on its own when a player or a vehicle comes within DangerEventRange (50 m), then lands again after ReactionCooldown (35 s). Rows are rigid: shift, never stretch."
